<title>POLAND: GPRD WINS A PLN 23 MLN TENDER.</title>
<headline>GPRD WINS A PLN 23 MLN TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish road builder GPRD SA has won a tender to reconstruct and modernize the Zychlin railway station worth 23.1 million zlotys to the company, the firm said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The TOR consortium has won a tender worth 28.9 million zlotys...(and) GPRD's share in the tender amounts to 23.1 million,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
